{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-19","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与角","englishTitle":"If two planes which cut one another be at right angles to any plane, their common section will also be at right angles to the same plane.","book":11,"number":19,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.19","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.19/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":19,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","contentId":"euclid-11-19","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b16bae170f7f40f2932570739d1f1707e261972dee15d56193e6bcfde823317","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-19.statement","euclid-11-19.construction.1","euclid-11-19.proof.1","euclid-11-19.proof.2","euclid-11-19.proof.3","euclid-11-19.proof.4","euclid-11-19.proof.5","euclid-11-19.conclusion","euclid-11-19.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-19.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-19","revisionId":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ecb7da8206f8b5a8acd58e78e1d1f3b754a1737cf8e4ef9e12ca3702083c9103","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two planes which cut one another be at right angles to any plane, their common section will also be at right angles to the same plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个平面分, 彼此为直角分, 则平面分, 其共同部分也将为直角分, 同一部分为平面分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-19.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-19","revisionId":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6a3d136a1ea6790ade518936dce2fe499bb894540d3233b8e2ebe43eb88130a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two planes AB, BC be at right angles to the plane of reference, and let BD be their common section; I say that BD is at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这两条平面 AB,BC在直角,提及平面,BD成为其共同部分;我说,BD在直角,提及平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-19.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-19","revisionId":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ecbf5dcc3e1cb3e2c79bcedcaea77ad1fd80bd6c6c108aa6fbf771aa20faf24","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For suppose it is not, and from the point D let DE be drawn in the plane AB at right angles to the straight line AD, and DF in the plane BC at right angles to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设不是,从直角AB线到直角AB线,从DDE线到AD线,从平面BC直角CD线到DF线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-19.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-19","revisionId":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10dfa6385e3dc42914b3aad196806c6a37a7c562a8188ec2747f8a7244ce38d9","citations":["euclid-11-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the plane AB is at right angles to the plane of reference, and DE has been drawn in the plane AB at right angles to AD, their common section, therefore DE is at right angles to the plane of reference. [[XI. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-11-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于平面 AB为直角,而DE为直角,直角至AD为平面,共同部分,因此,DE为直角。 [[XI. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-11-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-19.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-19","revisionId":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c270422e815af46f0b8f103a796bf67ca667bf85e4a921817455b0507aeafd79","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that DF is also at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,DF也是直角,即平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-19.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-19","revisionId":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce0ead1219904e9ebee9ca36ca2b908715a175d7a0a71fab6a29010b281acf32","citations":["euclid-11-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore from the same point D two straight lines have been set up at right angles to the plane of reference on the same side: which is impossible. [[XI. 13](/principles/euclid-11-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在同一侧,从同一点D起,在直角至平面起的参照线上,划定了两条直线:这是不可能的。 [[XI. 13](/principles/euclid-11-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-19.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-19","revisionId":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1633eca4dd8d61c45cc77fcbfba2a15413d1447143cf5b6daa5163da077c9409","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no straight line except the common section DB of the planes AB, BC can be set up from the point D at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,除了平面 AB、BC公路的共同部分第DB节外,不能在参考点直角至平面之间设立直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-19.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-19","revisionId":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-19.source","contentId":"euclid-11-19","revisionId":"euclid-11-19@raw-4b16bae170f7f40f","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f541b0fff5e006490b26fb7ada179f62c83991f56afc6593d9ba56f5598472cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.19/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.19\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-19:euclid-11-def-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-19.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.19/","sourceLabel":"XI. Def. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-19:euclid-11-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-19","sou